tps://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jcvhORFeeFG9aUjdorL449ENnRT.jpg"},{"id":4875804,"name":"Brandon Richardson","role":"Factory Worker"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Corpi da reato","overview":"L’agente speciale dell’FBI Sarah Washburn è un’investigatrice metodica, con un’ottima reputazione ma un’estrema arroganza. L’ufficiale di polizia di Boston Shannon Mullins è invece sboccata e senza mezze misure. Nessuna di loro ha mai avuto un partner, o anche solo un’amica. Quando questi due caratteri incompatibili sono costretti a unire le forze per fermare uno spietato boss della droga, si troveranno a dover combattere contro un pericoloso cartello criminale e, peggio ancora, l’una contro l’altra.","tagline":"Il caso più difficile che devono affrontare è lavorare insieme"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Uptight and straight-laced, FBI Special Agent Sarah Ashburn is a methodical investigator with a reputation for excellence--and hyper-arrogance. Shannon Mullins, one of Boston P.D.'s \"finest,\" is foul-mouthed and has a very short fuse, and uses her gut instinct and street smarts to catch the most elusive criminals. Neither has ever had a partner, or a friend for that matter. When these two wildly incompatible law officers join forces to bring down a ruthless drug lord, they become the last thing anyone expected: buddies.","tagline":"They're just trying to stay alive long enough to kill each other."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lF53ZX8JtpFkGrSokxnnmn0pSMa.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c0V8KAiuoWLXf7TfvwHK4yhIfb9.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}},"tmdb:inventory-v2:series":{"originalLanguage":"en-US","images":{"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yERBa1y5zNUOTRKQPiDCPIc2fuv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yERBa1y5zNUOTRKQPiDCPIc2fuv.jpg","language":"en","wid